    repeat: 0
  - lines:
    - your destination is the great city of aorta. find the flower girl, she will
      guide you through.
    - 'but before leaving, you must learn to externalize your slime, just as you
      can your spectra! '
    - 'i''m sure the nearby slime garden will prove enlightening... '
